{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters in this game are eighteen years old or above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Synopsis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cow &quot;&quot;Bessie&quot;&quot; is delivering milk to the village of Lemingrad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But she is met by many monsters and soldiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bessie is lactating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bessie can drink her milk to upgrade her talents and to heal her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When she is defeated by a monster or a soldier, she gets into big trouble...!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide her through the map so she can make her delivery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle x Dungeon Crawler - This game is quick and fun with simple controls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the map and collect items: skill-enhancing magic stones, healing mushrooms, and talent points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the keys to go to the next area in the maze-like map!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters and soldiers are blocking her way. There are traps, such as toxic mushrooms, everywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without enough magic stones, she will be unable to pass through them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the map carefully and watch out for her status!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3367320?t=1757313255","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3367320?t=1757313255","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367320/b755bf799f673cfcf2cab5c0e26a86bf501399a6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757313255","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367320/b755bf799f673cfcf2cab5c0e26a86bf501399a6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757313255","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"The game includes the following adult content:\r\n-Numerous nudity and sexual acts.\r\n-Sexual acts by monsters.\r\n-Non-consensual sexual acts.\r\n-Pregnancy of characters.\r\n-Sexual acts by tentacles.\r\n-Sex with beasts.\r\n-Sexual acts involving physical restraints.\r\n-Sexual acts by more than one person.\r\n-Milking\r\n-Hypnosis\r\n"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All characters in this game are eighteen years old or above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Synopsis</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your cow &quot;&quot;Bessie&quot;&quot; is delivering milk to the village of Lemingrad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But she is met by many monsters and soldiers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bessie is lactating.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bessie can drink her milk to upgrade her talents and to heal her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When she is defeated by a monster or a soldier, she gets into big trouble...!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide her through the map so she can make her delivery!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle x Dungeon Crawler - This game is quick and fun with simple controls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the map and collect items: skill-enhancing magic stones, healing mushrooms, and talent points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the keys to go to the next area in the maze-like map!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters and soldiers are blocking her way. There are traps, such as toxic mushrooms, everywhere!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Without enough magic stones, she will be unable to pass through them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the map carefully and watch out for her status!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["\u30b7\u30e5\u30c8\u30a5\u30eb\u30e2\u30f4\u30a3\u30fc\u30af"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3367320/cb24ad482012f9930341d2df30822583e842aab3/header.jpg?t=1757313255","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3367320/1908921438/2cd47b9e3e6945786c5ccca9d8abf9847e0c76d8/1756802446/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756873651","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3367320/1908921438/2cd47b9e3e6945786c5ccca9d8abf9847e0c76d8/1756802446/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756873651","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3367320/1908921438/2cd47b9e3e6945786c5ccca9d8abf9847e0c76d8/1756802446/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756873651","id":257075779,"name":"pv","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257075779/7a3c19eac7f5a74aaf8276b7d59a901b43bc0640/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1756873651"}],"name":"Bessie's Milk Delivery","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"Bessie's Milk Delivery - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">$4.99</span> $1.99 USD","packageid":1191662,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":"-60% ","price_in_cents_with_discount":199}],"title":"Buy Bessie's Milk Delivery"}],"packages":[1191662],"pc_requirements":{"minim